# `pacda x0, x1` or `autda x0, x1` (sign's and auth's canonical forms) with
# SCTLR.EnDA clear, in one configuration (pac-footprint.job.in): the
# pointer comes back unchanged, and `autda` (prepended as `fallthrough`)
# does not fault, in both models. run.sh prepends the insn line (and
# `pc-step` for Armv9.4-A) and substitutes @SCTLR@.
abstract ComputePAC
writes R0
no-mem-write
mem-reads 0
flags-preserved
assume (= ((_ extract 27 27) init.@SCTLR@) #b0)
assert (= final.R0 init.R0)
